" Copy this file to custom/plugins.vim.  The local file is intentionally
" ignored by Git so Onesimus updates never compete with personal plugins.

" Plug 'wakatime/vim-wakatime'

" Cogitatum inquiry notes. OnesimusPlugin applies the reviewed source pin.
" Use a CLI built from the compiler revision listed in that plugin's README.
" call OnesimusPlugin('BaksiLi/vim-cogitatum', { 'do': 'npm ci && npm run build' })

" Developing a plugin locally: override its checkout without changing the
" public declaration. Local builds remain explicit; PlugUpdate leaves it alone.
" let g:onesimus_plugin_overrides = {
"       \ 'vim-cogitatum': '~/Developer/vim-cogitatum',
"       \ 'texinsitu.vim': '~/Developer/texinsitu.vim',
"       \ }

" texinsitu.vim currently needs a local checkout plus utftex. Its remote
" repository is not published yet; declare it only with an override above.
" call OnesimusPlugin('BaksiLi/texinsitu.vim')
